+| Code | Reasons |
+|---|---|
+| `ADMISSION_REJECTED` | `INVALID_ENVELOPE`, `INVALID_IDENTIFIER`, `RESERVED_IDENTIFIER`, `INVALID_TIER`, `INVALID_AUTHORING_TARGET`, `DUPLICATE_IDENTITY`, `IMMUTABLE_NAME`, `TIER_DEMOTION` |
