-| `NAMESPACE_STRUCTURAL_VALIDATION_FAILED` | `STRUCTURAL` | `INVALID_ENVELOPE`, `INVALID_IDENTIFIER`, `RESERVED_IDENTIFIER`, `INVALID_TIER`, `INVALID_AUTHORING_TARGET`, `DUPLICATE_IDENTITY` |
